sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Desarrollador
    participant GitHub as GitHub Repository
    participant Actions as GitHub Actions
    participant ECR as Amazon ECR
    participant EC2 as Amazon EC2 (SSM)

    Dev->>GitHub: git push origin deploy
    GitHub->>Actions: Trigger workflow on 'deploy' branch
    
    rect rgb(200, 220, 240)
        Note over Actions: Fase de Build
        Actions->>Actions: Checkout source code
        Actions->>Actions: Configure AWS Credentials
        Actions->>Actions: docker build (Multi-stage)
        Actions->>Actions: docker tag latest & v1
    end
    
    rect rgb(220, 240, 200)
        Note over Actions,ECR: Fase de Push
        Actions->>ECR: Login to Amazon ECR
        Actions->>ECR: docker push image:latest
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 220, 200)
        Note over Actions,EC2: Fase de Despliegue (CD)
        Actions->>EC2: aws ssm send-command
        EC2->>ECR: docker pull new image
        EC2->>EC2: docker stop & rm old container
        EC2->>EC2: docker run --network app-network
    end
    
    EC2-->>Dev: Aplicación Actualizada Disponible
